# Flavor Find Engine — Internal Test Console
#
# The API base URL and key are injected at runtime by the Django template
# (templates/console/index.html) via window.__FF_API_BASE__ and
# window.__FF_API_KEY__. No build-time env vars are needed.
#
# For local development with `npm run dev`, the SPA falls back to
# same-origin requests (empty base) and reads the API key from
# localStorage (key: ff_console_api_key). Enter your key in the
# console's API Key input field.
